From 257de481635daffb9f55d23e2f223be890267fc6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hoangvu12 <hggaming91@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:30:27 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] nightly: zgx from hoangvu12/zgx nightly-design, with the
 Design plugin's zgx PRs

The app (apps/zgx) and, with #1367, the engine build against zgx at one
rev. Both now take it from hoangvu12/zgx's nightly-design branch: the rev
zeron/zgx pins (06c6d56) with these zgx PRs cherry-picked onto it:

- #2074 ui.load_font: a script loads a font file and names its family
- #2080 ui.render_canvas: a canvas drawing to a PNG with no window, its
  text in the app's own fonts and a paragraph wrapped at its width
- #2076 canvas text: line height, letter spacing, a wrap width
- #2081 c:image: a canvas draws pictures
- #2082 c:shadow: a canvas draws shadows

Every zgx line moves, the [patch] entries (wgpu-hal, winit, accesskit)
too, so the whole graph comes from one rev; both lockfiles are the same
graph from the new source.
